    # MACHINE STEP
    # == AD LABEL (8): LEAD WORD TRAIL where LEAD is trims then separators
    # or whitespace then controls or whitespace and TRAIL mirrors it
    # States in ts: 0 dead; 1 2 3 the lead phases A B C; 4 5 6 the trail
    # phases C B A; 7 inside the whitespace of paid partnership; 8 the trie
    # root; 9 to 192 trie nodes; wt is 1 on a node ending a word
    # u holds a pending UTF8 lead byte of a separator or whitespace: 1 C0;
    # 2 C2; 3 E1; 4 E1 9A; 5 E2; 6 E2 80; 7 E2 81; 8 E3; 9 E3 80
